{
  "kanji": "険",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 険\ntitle: steep; perilous\njlpt: 3\ntags: [jlpt-n3, grade-5, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 11\nradical: 阜\nradicalNumber: 170\nonyomi: [ケン]\nkunyomi: [けわ.しい]\ndistractors: [限, 院, 験]\n---\n\n# 険 — steep; perilous\n\n**Strokes:** 11 · **Key (radical):** 阜 (as left-hand 阝, no. 170) · **JLPT:** N3 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n険 occurs in steep or difficult terrain and in danger-related words.\n険しい けわしい can describe a steep, rugged route; [危険](../words/危険.md) きけん means danger or dangerous.\n[冒険](../words/冒険.md) ぼうけん names an adventure or venture.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** picture the pointed upper shape and spread lower strokes beside 阝 as a difficult slope.\nThis image is a mnemonic, not a historical explanation.\n\n## Readings\n\nThe table selects useful readings; the metadata preserves the complete source reading list.\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| けわ.しい | kun | 険しい けわしい — steep; rugged |\n| ケン | on | [危険](../words/危険.md) きけん — danger; 冒険 ぼうけん — adventure |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [危険](../words/危険.md) きけん — danger; dangerous\n- 険しい けわしい — steep; rugged\n- 冒険 ぼうけん — adventure; venture\n\n## Notes\n\n険しい is an い-adjective: 険しい道 (けわしいみち), \"a steep, rugged path.\"\n危険 is a な-adjective when it modifies a noun: 危険な道 (きけんなみち), \"a dangerous path.\"\n[験](験.md) has the same right-hand shape but 馬 on the left, not 阝.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project).\nDictionary: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1218560, 1260530, 1519830.\n",
